-	Slowed everything down, a lot of elements happened too fast and we hard to keep up with.
-	Adjust AI difficulty to be better/smarter overall.
-	Fixed multiple pop ups happening at the same time when a new turn began.
-	Added music.
-	Added a unit death animation.
